\"IIT-JEE 2011 Paper 1 Offline Physics - Simple Harmonic Motion Question 20 English Option 4\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l2logivt/696ea8f8-e24c-4b31-8757-fa500d7971bd/28fc8890-c86a-11ec-89fd-bbbe9a45bfc7/file-1l2logivu.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l2logivt/696ea8f8-e24c-4b31-8757-fa500d7971bd/28fc8890-c86a-11ec-89fd-bbbe9a45bfc7/file-1l2logivu.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l2logivt/696ea8f8-e24c-4b31-8757-fa500d7971bd/28fc8890-c86a-11ec-89fd-bbbe9a45bfc7/file-1l2logivu.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l2logivt/696ea8f8-e24c-4b31-8757-fa500d7971bd/28fc8890-c86a-11ec-89fd-bbbe9a45bfc7/file-1l2logivu.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l2logivt/696ea8f8-e24c-4b31-8757-fa500d7971bd/28fc8890-c86a-11ec-89fd-bbbe9a45bfc7/file-1l2logivu.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l2logivt/696ea8f8-e24c-4b31-8757-fa500d7971bd/28fc8890-c86a-11ec-89fd-bbbe9a45bfc7/file-1l2logivu.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\">"}],"correct_options":["D"],"explanation":"<p>Let the ball of mass m be thrown up with an initial velocity u. Its velocity v and displacement x are related by v<sup>2</sup> <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> u<sup>2</sup> = <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>2gx, where g is the acceleration due to gravity. The momentum (p = mv) is given by</p>\n<p>p<sup>2</sup> = m<sup>2</sup>u<sup>2</sup> <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 2m<sup>2</sup>gx,</p>\n<p>which gives</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.577ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22.73ex\" height=\"2.851ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1005 10046.7 1260\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(780.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1836.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"B1\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-B1\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msqrt\" transform=\"translate(2614.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,95)\"><use data-c=\"221A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-221A\"></use></g><g transform=\"translate(1020,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(911,289) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1314.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(605,289) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2545.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3545.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(4045.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(911,289) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(5360.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D454\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D454\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(5840.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"6412.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"1020\" y=\"885\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n<p>At x = 0, the momentum is mu when the ball starts going up and it becomes <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>mu when the ball comes back. At the maximum height, x = u<sup>2</sup>/(2g), the momentum becomes zero.</p>"}]}